  FT["MY-H1101"] = {"id":"MY-H1101","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 128/1996&status=PINDAAN","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1996年国会议员（报酬）（附表一修正）令","en":"MEMBERS OF PARLIAMENT (REMUNERATION) (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 1996","orig":"MEMBERS OF PARLIAMENT (REMUNERATION) (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 1996","ms":"Perintah Ahli Parlimen (Saraan) (Pindaan Jadual Pertama) 1996","vi":"Lệnh về Các nghị sĩ (Thù lao) (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ nhất) năm 1996","th":"คำสั่งสมาชิกรัฐสภา (ค่าตอบแทน) (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกแรก) ค.ศ. 1996","id":"Perintah Anggota Parlemen (Remunerasi) (Perubahan Lampiran Pertama) Tahun 1996"},"level":"regulation","category":"01_宪法与基础法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA128","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1996","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\01_宪法与基础法\\1996_P.U.(A)128-1996_MEMBERS OF PARLIAMENT (REMUNERATION) (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 1996.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H1101-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Ahli Parlimen\n(Saraan) (Pindaan Jadual Pertama) 1996 dan hendaklah disifatkan\ntelah mula berkuatkuasa pada 5 April 1995."}},{"id":"MY-H1101-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual Pertama kepada Akta Ahli Parlimen (Saraan) 1980 adalah\ndipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan 4 perenggan yang\nberikut:\n\n\"Ganjaran   4a. (1) Tanpa menjejaskan perenggan 4, seseorang\nbagi Anggota Anggota Pentadbiran yang ialah Ahli Dewan Rakyat boleh,\nPentadbiran apabila terbubarnya Parlimen, diberi ganjaran yang\n\ntertentu\napabila      dihitung mengikut formula yang berikut:\nterbubarnya\nParlimen,\n\n1/48 x gaji x 12 x tempoh perkhidmatan yang boleh\ndimasukira tidak-melebihi-72-bulan.—\n\nAkta 237.\n\nNama dan mula\nberkuatkuasa\n\nPindaan\nJadual Pertama.\nAkta 237.\n\nP.U. (A) 128.\n\nAct 237\n\nCitation and\ncommencement\n\nAmendment of\nFirst Schedule\nAct 237\n\n(2) Ganjaran yang kena dibayar di bawah perenggan\nini hendaklah atas asas gaji sehabis tinggi yang diterima\noleh dan tempoh perkhidmatan yang boleh dimasukira\nbagi Anggota Pentadbiran yang ialah Ahli Dewan Rakyat\npada masa terbubarnya Parlimen.\n\n(3) Apa-apa ganjaran yang telah dibayar kepada\nAnggota Pentadbiran yang ialah Ahli Dewan Rakyat\napabila terbubarnya Parlimen hendaklah dipotong daripada\nganjaran yang kena dibayar di bawah perenggan ini.\".\n\nDibuat 14 Mac 1996.\n\n[JPA/PEN\n\n(R) 228/26/6-12; PN. (PU?) 369/III.]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah,\n\nTan Sri Dato' Seri AHMAD Sari BIN ABDUL HAMID,\nSetiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\nMEMBERS OF PARLIAMENT (REMUNERATION) ACT 1980\n\nMEMBERS OF PARLIAMENT (REMUNERATION)\n\n(AMENDMENT OF FirsT SCHEDULE) ORDER 1996\n\nIn exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 19a of the First\nSchedule to the Members of Parliament (Remuneration) Act 1980,\nthe Yang di-Pertuan Agong makes the following order:"}}],"pack":"my-2"};
